# Test coverage
coverage
.nyc_output

# Environment files — no secret may ever appear in a VITE_* variable
# (FRONTEND_PLAN.md Rule 9, architecture §8.1), because every VITE_* value is
# inlined into the bundle and readable in the browser.
#
# .env.development and .env.production are therefore tracked on purpose: they are
# public by construction, they carry only a relative API path and two timeouts,
# and tests/guards/repository.test.ts reads them to prove it. Only genuinely local
# overrides are ignored.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.local

